  "finalText": "All 50 tests pass, typecheck and lint are clean. Here's a summary of the changes:\n\n### Changes made\n\n**`apps/extension/src/status-bar.ts`** — Added `indexing()` method to `StatusBarController` that sets the status bar to `\"CodeAtlas: indexing…\"` with a tooltip, giving immediate visual feedback when a build/update starts.\n\n**`apps/extension/src/commands.ts`** — Two fixes:\n1. **`runCli`**: Calls `statusBar?.indexing()` before `runner.run()` so the status bar immediately reflects that work is in progress, instead of showing the stale previous state.\n2. **`refresh`**: Clears `client.lastBuildError` when the index is available, so a prior build failure doesn't persist in the status bar after a manual refresh.\n\n**`apps/extension/src/extension-core.ts`** — Passes `statusBar` through `CommandContext` so the command handlers can update it directly for intermediate states.\n\n**`apps/extension/tests/commands.test.ts`** — Three new tests:\n- Verifies the status bar shows `\"indexing…\"` while the CLI is running (using a slow runner with a deferred promise)\n- Verifies the status bar shows `\"build failed\"` after a failing run completes\n- Verifies the `refresh` command clears a stale `lastBuildError` when the index is available",
